"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_1114552525676893_1677870913491985454_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ugs39EuMTSgQ7kNvwGHzlcg&_nc_oc=AdqjVHWjYkVTyOsZYiOWwzgVrvIDp1vRoMp8yaVjWSo_GjIjq7vSme3dFa_2h1oYnWQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBXdXpZKpAPjl4Htw0tmVSjPbY4VZnPcA6cs8wpIFeTWA&oe=6A538947"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "be a superhuman cover image.png", "id": "942148429692825", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974499_942148433026158_7347930193473508401_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ABwwWBkGh8oQ7kNvwGJha0o&_nc_oc=Adr6Q4TH-V41kxp3bSHbWrYuz2Wi7QA5wWxb1sFBNgCaDydqB2OkB_SrjXsun4BfQxM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDw8USpMF_cEuQxzUlsQVvxyJwuo3l9tIvRvgOqXvWk4A&oe=6A5399D4"}, "display_name": "Villa", "keywords": ["among", "team", "fly", "social", "design"], "long_description": "* Standups, roadmapping, happy hours, board meetings, design, 1:1s, and offsites that are out of this world and far better than IRL\n* A creativity platform, much like Zoom + Slack in 3D. Our focus is teams, giving tech professionals superpowers to be their best\n* The answer to \u2018videoconference fatigue\u2019 by putting you in thrilling immersive meeting experiences, giving you the tools to interact, co-invent and play\n* A meeting in VR is multiples more effective than IRL meetings with massive screens, and activities that defy physics like drawing in the air\n* Launched with multiple locations around the world. At the heart of each such micro-universe is your Villa, always the same, and always unique as you personalize it to reflect your team and org\u2019s personality and identity\n* Boost in culture, the glue that holds everyone to a common mission which is tricky in remote\n* Improved camaraderie and positive workplace feelings\n* Big CapEx and OpEx savings to your company relative to 